<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Fietser — let op in het verkeer</title>
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;background:#f5f5f0;}
  .page{width:900px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;}

  .topbar{background:#6ab023;padding:18px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;}
  .topbar-logo{width:36px;height:36px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
  .topbar-logo svg{width:22px;height:22px;}
  .topbar h1{color:#fff;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;}
  .topbar p{color:#d4f0a0;font-size:13px;margin-top:2px;}

  .main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;gap:0;}

  .left{background:#6ab023;padding:24px 22px 28px;position:relative;min-height:620px;}
  .left h2{color:#fff;font-size:36px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .left p{color:#d4f0a0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .left-bike{margin-top:20px;text-align:center;}
  .left-bike svg{width:200px;height:130px;}
  .stat-pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);border-radius:30px;padding:8px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .stat-pill .num{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;}
  .stat-pill .lbl{font-size:11px;color:#d4f0a0;line-height:1.3;}

  .right{background:#fff;padding:0;}

  .stats-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);background:#f0f7e0;}
  .stat-box{padding:16px 14px;border-right:2px solid #d8edaa;text-align:center;}
  .stat-box:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .stat-box .big{font-size:28px;font-weight:900;color:#6ab023;line-height:1;}
  .stat-box .sub{font-size:11px;color:#555;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.3;}

  .section{padding:16px 20px 8px;}
  .sec-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#6ab023;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;border-bottom:2px solid #6ab023;padding-bottom:4px;margin-bottom:12px;}

  .gevaren-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;padding:0 20px 14px;}
  .gevaar{border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;}
  .gevaar .icon-circle{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;}
  .gevaar .icon-circle svg{width:22px;height:22px;}
  .gevaar h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px;}
  .gevaar p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;}
  .g-red{background:#fee8e8;} .g-red .icon-circle{background:#e24b4a;} .g-red h3{color:#a32d2d;} .g-red p{color:#c0392b;}
  .g-amber{background:#fef3d8;} .g-amber .icon-circle{background:#f0a500;} .g-amber h3{color:#7a4f00;} .g-amber p{color:#9a6200;}
  .g-blue{background:#e6f1fb;} .g-blue .icon-circle{background:#378add;} .g-blue h3{color:#0c447c;} .g-blue p{color:#185fa5;}
  .g-purple{background:#eeedfe;} .g-purple .icon-circle{background:#7f77dd;} .g-purple h3{color:#3c3489;} .g-purple p{color:#534ab7;}

  .bottom-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;}
  .regels{background:#2c2c2a;padding:16px 20px 18px;}
  .regels .sec-title{color:#6ab023;border-color:#6ab023;}
  .regel-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:9px;}
  .regel-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;}
  .regel-item p{font-size:12px;color:#d3d1c7;line-height:1.45;}
  .regel-item p strong{color:#f1efe8;}

  .donut-section{background:#f0f7e0;padding:16px 20px 18px;}
  .donut-section .sec-title{color:#3b6d11;border-color:#3b6d11;}
  .donut-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:4px;}
  .donut-wrap svg{flex-shrink:0;}
  .legend{flex:1;}
  .leg-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:7px;}
  .leg-dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;}
  .leg-item span{font-size:11px;color:#3b6d11;line-height:1.3;}

  .footer{background:#6ab023;padding:10px 28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}
  .footer p{color:#d4f0a0;font-size:11px;}
  .footer strong{color:#fff;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-logo">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6ab023" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="5" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="17" r="2"/>
        <path d="M12 9V5M5 15l4-5M19 15l-4-5M5 15h14"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h1>Fietsers — let op in het verkeer</h1>
      <p>Je hebt doorgang, maar alertheid is altijd vereist</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="main">
    <div class="left">
      <h2>Veilig fietsen begint bij jou</h2>
      <p>Nederland telt ruim 23 miljoen fietsen. Elk jaar zijn fietsers betrokken bij duizenden verkeersongevallen — vaak vermijdbaar.</p>

      <div class="stat-pill">
        <div class="num">23M</div>
        <div class="lbl">fietsen in<br>Nederland</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-pill">
        <div class="num">58.000</div>
        <div class="lbl">fietsers gewond<br>per jaar</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-pill">
        <div class="num">77%</div>
        <div class="lbl">ongelukken<br>zijn vermijdbaar</div>
      </div>

      <div class="left-bike">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 130" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="50" cy="90" r="32" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="6"/>
          <circle cx="150" cy="90" r="32" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="6"/>
          <circle cx="50" cy="90" r="5" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="150" cy="90" r="5" fill="#fff"/>
          <polyline points="50,90 80,45 120,45 150,90" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <line x1="50" y1="90" x2="80" y2="45" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <polyline points="100,45 100,28 120,28" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="112" y1="28" x2="130" y2="28" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="100" cy="21" r="10" fill="#d4f0a0"/>
          <ellipse cx="100" cy="16" rx="8" ry="5" fill="#fff"/>
          <line x1="80" y1="45" x2="100" y2="45" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="right">
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="big">1 op 3</div><div class="sub">fietsers kijkt<br>op telefoon</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="big">40%</div><div class="sub">ongelukken bij<br>kruispunten</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="big">1,5 m</div><div class="sub">veilige afstand<br>tot geparkeerde auto</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="big">5 sec</div><div class="sub">reactietijd bij<br>80 km/u vrachtwagen</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="sec-title">Gevaarlijke situaties</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gevaren-grid">
        <div class="gevaar g-red">
          <div class="icon-circle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
              <rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div><h3>Dode hoek vrachtwagen</h3><p>Rechtsafslaande vrachtwagens zien fietsers niet. Stop altijd en wacht.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gevaar g-amber">
          <div class="icon-circle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
              <path d="M5 17H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3"/><rect x="9" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="16" r="1"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div><h3>Openend autoportier</h3><p>Houd 1,5 meter afstand van geparkeerde auto's — portieren openen plotseling.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gevaar g-blue">
          <div class="icon-circle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div><h3>Voetgangers op fietspad</h3><p>Voetgangers stappen onverwacht op het pad. Remmen en bellen op tijd.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gevaar g-purple">
          <div class="icon-circle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
              <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div><h3>Telefoon tijdens rijden</h3><p>Geen telefoon of oortjes. 1 seconde afleiding = 15 meter blind rijden.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-row">
        <div class="regels">
          <div class="sec-title">Verkeersregels</div>
          <div class="regel-item">
            <div class="regel-dot" style="background:#6ab023;"></div>
            <p><strong>Fietspad gebruiken</strong> waar aanwezig — op rijbaan uiterst rechts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="regel-item">
            <div class="regel-dot" style="background:#6ab023;"></div>
            <p><strong>Richting aangeven</strong> met arm bij afslaan, ook met voorrang.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="regel-item">
            <div class="regel-dot" style="background:#f0a500;"></div>
            <p><strong>Eigen controle</strong> — controleer altijd zelf of weg vrij is.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="regel-item">
            <div class="regel-dot" style="background:#f0a500;"></div>
            <p><strong>Verlichting</strong> — verplicht bij duisternis of mist.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="regel-item">
            <div class="regel-dot" style="background:#e24b4a;"></div>
            <p><strong>Rood = stop</strong> — ook als het rustig lijkt op het kruispunt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="donut-section">
          <div class="sec-title">Oorzaak fietsongeval</div>
          <div class="donut-wrap">
            <svg width="100" height="100" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="38" fill="none" stroke="#e24b4a" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="95 144" stroke-dashoffset="0"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="38" fill="none" stroke="#f0a500" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="57 144" stroke-dashoffset="-95"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="38" fill="none" stroke="#378add" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="43 144" stroke-dashoffset="-152"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="38" fill="none" stroke="#d3d1c7" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="44 144" stroke-dashoffset="-195"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="26" fill="#f0f7e0"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="legend">
              <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#e24b4a;"></div><span><strong>40%</strong> geen voorrang geven</span></div>
              <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#f0a500;"></div><span><strong>24%</strong> afleiding / telefoon</span></div>
              <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#378add;"></div><span><strong>18%</strong> dode hoek</span></div>
              <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#d3d1c7;"></div><span><strong>18%</strong> overige oorzaken</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>Ontwerp gebaseerd op rijkswijd fietsonderzoek 2023</p>
    <p><strong>Veilig fietsen = zien én gezien worden</strong></p>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
